@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### List known job types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/types

### Create a job that always succeeds
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobType": "SuccessfulJob"
}

### Create a job that fails twice then succeeds (demonstrates automatic recovery)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobType": "FlakyJob",
  "payload": { "failuresBeforeSuccess": 2 }
}

### Create a job that always fails, with a low retry cap (demonstrates dead-lettering quickly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobType": "AlwaysFailJob",
  "maxRetries": 2
}

### List jobs (optionally filter by status / jobType)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?page=1&pageSize=20

### List only dead-lettered jobs via the jobs endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?status=DEAD_LETTER

### Dashboard stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/stats

### Get one job's full detail (replace the id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get one job's attempt history (replace the id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/attempts

### Cancel a queued/retrying job (replace the id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel

### List dead-lettered jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dead-letters

### Get one dead-letter record (replace the id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dead-letters/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Requeue a dead-lettered job as a brand-new job (replace the id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dead-letters/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/requeue
